# Not for the public repo. Untracked (kept on disk locally), gitignored so `npm run guard`
# — which scans untracked-but-not-ignored files too — does not read them.
#   · the old single-file prototype, which embeds real usage data (real project names)
#   · the internal build-process docs (PROGRESS tracks fixtures/state; ORCHESTRATION discusses
#     another project). Build-process docs stay local; the app + PRD/STACK/DESIGN/FRONTEND ship.
Claude Lens (standalone).html
PROGRESS.md
ORCHESTRATION.md

# Untracked because it leaks a real home path (`/Users/<author>/.claude`), which
# `npm run guard` fails on for every git-tracked file. P-33 / STACK ADR-015: this
# repo is published. The document is a historical input; STACK.md and DESIGN.md
# carry everything it decided.
DESIGN_INPUT.md

# The macOS launcher is a BUILD OUTPUT (DESIGN.md ADR-038), not a distribution artifact.
# It is generated by `npm run launcher` from resources/icon.svg, it is ~50 KB, and — unlike
# every other generated thing here — it records an absolute path to this checkout so the
# copy in /Applications can find it. `npm run guard` scans untracked-but-not-ignored files
# (P-33), so these entries are what keep a generated absolute path out of the gate.
/Claude Lens.app/
/.claude-lens-icon/
# The icon work directory and its product, wherever `--out` puts them.
*.iconset/
*.icns

# Build-harness docs — kept local, not shipped to the public repo
CLAUDE.md
